{"seq":1,"slug":"dependency-injection-mobile","title":"移动端依赖注入","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-architecture-patterns/cross-cutting/dependency-injection-mobile","wordCount":1019,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"移动端依赖注入\">移动端依赖注入</h1><p>依赖注入（Dependency Injection, DI）在移动端架构中扮演的角色远超&quot;避免手动 new 对象&quot;——它是实现模块化的胶水层、是可测试性的前提条件、是 Feature 之间通过接口通信的运行时基础设施。没有 DI，Clean Architecture 的&quot;依赖倒置原则&quot;只是图纸上的箭头方向；有了 DI，每一个箭头都变成了运行时的具体连线。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>依赖倒置的运行时实现</strong>：DI 让 Clean Architecture 的&quot;内层不知道外层&quot;在运行时成为现实——接口在内层定义，实现在外层注册</li>\n<li><strong>Scope 与生命周期对齐</strong>：依赖的生命周期必须 ≤ 持有者的生命周期，违反会导致内存泄漏</li>\n<li><strong>测试时零成本替换</strong>：DI 的终极价值在于测试中可以将任意依赖替换为 Test Double 而不修改产品代码</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"di-的三种实现方式\">DI 的三种实现方式</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方式</th>\n<th>原理</th>\n<th>代表框架</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>编译期代码生成</td>\n<td>注解处理器 / KSP 在编译期生成工厂代码</td>\n<td>Dagger/Hilt (Android), Needle (iOS)</td>\n<td>大型应用，追求运行时零开销</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>运行时反射/容器</td>\n<td>启动时扫描注册、运行时查找依赖</td>\n<td>Koin (Kotlin), Swinject (Swift)</td>\n<td>中小型应用，追求简单配置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>手动构造器注入</td>\n<td>不用框架，在组合根手动连线</td>\n<td>无框架（Pure DI）</td>\n<td>极简项目，或框架不可用时</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>DI 复杂度</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>模块数</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>scope 种类</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>多线程需求</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{DI 复杂度} = f(\\text{模块数}, \\text{scope 种类}, \\text{多线程需求})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">DI </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">复杂度</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">模块数</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">scope </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">种类</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">多线程需求</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><h2 id=\"android-hilt-工业标准\">Android：Hilt 工业标准</h2><p>Hilt 是 Google 官方推荐的 Android DI 框架，基于 Dagger 2 的编译期代码生成，2026 年已成为 Android 项目的事实标准。其核心概念是<strong>预定义的 Component 层级</strong>对应 Android 生命周期：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    SC[SingletonComponent&lt;br/&gt;Application 生命周期] --&gt; AC[ActivityComponent&lt;br/&gt;Activity 生命周期]&#10;    AC --&gt; FC[FragmentComponent&lt;br/&gt;Fragment 生命周期]&#10;    SC --&gt; VMC[ViewModelComponent&lt;br/&gt;ViewModel 生命周期]&#10;    SC --&gt; SC2[ServiceComponent&lt;br/&gt;Service 生命周期]\">graph TD\n    SC[SingletonComponent&lt;br/&gt;Application 生命周期] --&gt; AC[ActivityComponent&lt;br/&gt;Activity 生命周期]\n    AC --&gt; FC[FragmentComponent&lt;br/&gt;Fragment 生命周期]\n    SC --&gt; VMC[ViewModelComponent&lt;br/&gt;ViewModel 生命周期]\n    SC --&gt; SC2[ServiceComponent&lt;br/&gt;Service 生命周期]</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// 模块声明&#10;@Module&#10;@InstallIn(SingletonComponent::class)&#10;object NetworkModule {&#10;    @Provides&#10;    @Singleton&#10;    fun provideHttpClient(): HttpClient = HttpClient(OkHttp) {&#10;        install(ContentNegotiation) { json() }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    @Provides&#10;    @Singleton&#10;    fun provideOrderApi(client: HttpClient): OrderApi = OrderApiImpl(client)&#10;}&#10;&#10;@Module&#10;@InstallIn(ViewModelComponent::class)&#10;object RepositoryModule {&#10;    @Provides&#10;    @ViewModelScoped&#10;    fun provideOrderRepository(&#10;        api: OrderApi,&#10;        dao: OrderDao&#10;    ): OrderRepository = OrderRepositoryImpl(api, dao)&#10;}&#10;&#10;// ViewModel 注入&#10;@HiltViewModel&#10;class OrderListViewModel @Inject constructor(&#10;    private val getOrdersUseCase: GetOrdersUseCase&#10;) : ViewModel() { ... }\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 模块声明</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Module</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@InstallIn(SingletonComponent::class)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>object NetworkModule {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Provides</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Singleton</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun provideHttpClient(): HttpClient = HttpClient(OkHttp) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        install(ContentNegotiation) { json() }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Provides</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Singleton</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun provideOrderApi(client: HttpClient): OrderApi = OrderApiImpl(client)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Module</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@InstallIn(ViewModelComponent::class)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>object RepositoryModule {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Provides</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @ViewModelScoped</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun provideOrderRepository(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        api: OrderApi,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        dao: OrderDao</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ): OrderRepository = OrderRepositoryImpl(api, dao)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// ViewModel 注入</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@HiltViewModel</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class OrderListViewModel @Inject constructor(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val getOrdersUseCase: GetOrdersUseCase</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>) : ViewModel() { ... }</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"hilt-在模块化项目中的使用\">Hilt 在模块化项目中的使用</h3><p>每个 Feature 模块定义自己的 <code>@Module</code>，通过 <code>@InstallIn</code> 挂到合适的 Component。模块之间的接口绑定集中在 <code>:app</code> 模块或专门的 <code>:di</code> 桥接模块：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// feature-cart 模块对外暴露接口&#10;interface CartService {&#10;    fun getItemCount(): Flow&lt;Int&gt;&#10;}&#10;&#10;// feature-cart 模块内部实现&#10;@Module&#10;@InstallIn(SingletonComponent::class)&#10;abstract class CartModule {&#10;    @Binds&#10;    abstract fun bindCartService(impl: CartServiceImpl): CartService&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// feature-cart 模块对外暴露接口</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>interface CartService {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun getItemCount(): Flow&#x3C;Int></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// feature-cart 模块内部实现</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Module</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@InstallIn(SingletonComponent::class)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>abstract class CartModule {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Binds</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    abstract fun bindCartService(impl: CartServiceImpl): CartService</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"ios-swift-原生-di-策略\">iOS：Swift 原生 DI 策略</h2><p>iOS 生态没有 Hilt 这样的统一官方方案。2026 年的主流选择：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方案</th>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>局限</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Swift-Dependencies (Point-Free)</td>\n<td><code>@Dependency</code> property wrapper + TaskLocal</td>\n<td>TCA 一等集成、测试友好</td>\n<td>绑定 TCA 生态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Factory</td>\n<td>Container + 注册闭包</td>\n<td>轻量、Swift 原生</td>\n<td>运行时解析</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Swinject</td>\n<td>容器注册 + 协议解析</td>\n<td>功能全面</td>\n<td>运行时失败风险</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>手动组合根</td>\n<td>在 App 入口手动构造</td>\n<td>零依赖、编译期保证</td>\n<td>大型项目冗长</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Environment (SwiftUI)</td>\n<td><code>@Environment</code> / <code>@EnvironmentObject</code></td>\n<td>框架原生</td>\n<td>只适合 View 层</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"// 手动组合根模式（Pure DI）&#10;@main&#10;struct MyApp: App {&#10;    // 组合根：所有依赖在此连线&#10;    private let networkClient = URLSessionNetworkClient()&#10;    private let database = SQLiteDatabase()&#10;&#10;    private lazy var orderRepository = OrderRepositoryImpl(&#10;        remote: OrderRemoteDataSource(client: networkClient),&#10;        local: OrderLocalDataSource(db: database)&#10;    )&#10;&#10;    private lazy var getOrdersUseCase = GetOrdersUseCase(repository: orderRepository)&#10;&#10;    var body: some Scene {&#10;        WindowGroup {&#10;            OrderListView(&#10;                viewModel: OrderListViewModel(useCase: getOrdersUseCase)&#10;            )&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 手动组合根模式（Pure DI）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@main</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MyApp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">App </span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 组合根：所有依赖在此连线</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    private</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> networkClient </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> URLSessionNetworkClient</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    private</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> database </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> SQLiteDatabase</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    private</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> lazy</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orderRepository </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> OrderRepositoryImpl</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        remote</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">OrderRemoteDataSource</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">client</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: networkClient),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        local</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">OrderLocalDataSource</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">db</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: database)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    private</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> lazy</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> getOrdersUseCase </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> GetOrdersUseCase</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">repository</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: orderRepository)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> body: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">some</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Scene {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        WindowGroup</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            OrderListView</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">                viewModel</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">OrderListViewModel</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">useCase</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: getOrdersUseCase)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"// Swift-Dependencies 方案（TCA 生态）&#10;@DependencyClient&#10;struct OrderClient: Sendable {&#10;    var fetchOrders: @Sendable () async throws -&gt; [Order]&#10;    var placeOrder: @Sendable (Order) async throws -&gt; OrderConfirmation&#10;}&#10;&#10;extension OrderClient: DependencyKey {&#10;    static let liveValue = OrderClient(&#10;        fetchOrders: { try await URLSession.shared.decode([Order].self, from: ordersURL) },&#10;        placeOrder: { order in try await URLSession.shared.post(order, to: ordersURL) }&#10;    )&#10;    static let testValue = OrderClient(&#10;        fetchOrders: unimplemented(&quot;OrderClient.fetchOrders&quot;),&#10;        placeOrder: unimplemented(&quot;OrderClient.placeOrder&quot;)&#10;    )&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Swift-Dependencies 方案（TCA 生态）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@DependencyClient</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> OrderClient</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Sendable </span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fetchOrders: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@Sendable</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> throws</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [Order]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> placeOrder: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@Sendable</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (Order) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> throws</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -></span><span style=\"color