</div><h2 id=\"scope-管理-生命周期与依赖的对齐\">Scope 管理：生命周期与依赖的对齐</h2><p>DI 最容易出错的地方是 Scope 不匹配：一个 Activity-scoped 的对象持有了 Application-scoped 的引用（没问题），或反过来 Application-scoped 对象持有了 Activity-scoped 的引用（内存泄漏）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Scope</th>\n<th>生命周期</th>\n<th>典型注入对象</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Singleton</td>\n<td>Application 进程</td>\n<td>HttpClient, Database, Analytics</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ViewModelScoped</td>\n<td>ViewModel（跨配置变更存活）</td>\n<td>Repository, UseCase</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ActivityScoped</td>\n<td>Activity 实例</td>\n<td>Navigator, Snackbar Host</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CompositionLocal</td>\n<td>Composable 树分支</td>\n<td>Theme, Locale</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>安全规则</mtext><mo>:</mo><mtext>短生命周期对象</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>长生命周期对象</mtext><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">✓</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{安全规则}: \\text{短生命周期对象} \\rightarrow \\text{长生命周期对象} \\quad \\checkmark</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">安全规则</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">短生命周期对象</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6922em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">长生命周期对象</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord amsrm\">✓</span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>长生命周期对象</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>短生命周期对象</mtext><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo>×</mo><mtext>（内存泄漏）</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{长生命周期对象} \\rightarrow \\text{短生命周期对象} \\quad \\times \\text{（内存泄漏）}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">长生命周期对象</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">短生命周期对象</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">（内存泄漏）</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><h2 id=\"测试中的依赖替换\">测试中的依赖替换</h2><p>DI 的终极价值在于测试时可以替换任意依赖为 Test Double：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// Hilt 测试替换&#10;@HiltAndroidTest&#10;class OrderListViewModelTest {&#10;    @BindValue&#10;    val fakeRepository: OrderRepository = FakeOrderRepository(&#10;        orders = listOf(Order(id = &quot;1&quot;, name = &quot;Test Order&quot;))&#10;    )&#10;&#10;   